cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite the paper below."
title: "mad-inner-disk-rom: reduced connectivity model and predictive test for magnetically arrested accretion"
abstract: >-
  Data and code accompanying a study of a minimal reaction-diffusion closure for a
  connectivity order parameter in the inner region of a magnetically arrested black-hole
  accretion flow, driven by the horizon magnetic flux measured in a GRMHD simulation and
  tested out of sample against its own memoryless limit with a refitted surrogate null.
type: software
